Title: "Writing Text"
Id: "8ad412a7-d782-4a9b-95c6-525e6dbac9a4"

Text: "`WritingText` is raw text used by nested documented `writing:` groups.

```mlg-fragment
writing: f(x_) :~> f(x)
as:
. \"f(x)\"
```

It is distinct from the top-level `Writing:` block, whose right-hand side is parsed as a formulation writing alias body."
Id: "33684363-7626-45e8-b188-1c5df6140494"
